    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"Pipeline\"\nvignette: >\n  %\\VignetteIndexEntry{Pipeline}\n  %\\VignetteEngine{quarto::html}\n  %\\VignetteEncoding{UTF-8}\n---\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\n# Load the project's functions straight from the checkout with pkgload; the\n# repo is never installed (decision 0042). The site build sets CFB2NFL_ROOT,\n# a local render finds the checkout from the working directory.\nroot <- Sys.getenv(\"CFB2NFL_ROOT\")\nif (!nzchar(root)) root <- pkgload::pkg_path()\nknitr::opts_knit$set(root.dir = root)\npkgload::load_all(root, quiet = TRUE)\nlibrary(targets)\nlibrary(dplyr)\n```\n:::\n\n\nThe processing pipeline is a [`targets`](https://books.ropensci.org/targets/)\ngraph (decision 0004) — the single source of truth for how raw data becomes\nfeatures, models, and results. The map below is **generated from the graph**, so\nit can't drift from what the code actually does.\n\n## Stages\n\n```{mermaid}\nflowchart LR\n  ingest[ingest\\nCFBD + nflverse] --> clean[clean\\nstandardize + coerce keys]\n  clean --> link[link\\nplayer-season backbone + joins]\n  link --> features[features\\nlongitudinal change]\n  features --> model[model\\nexplain + predict]\n  model --> report[report\\nsite + viz]\n  clean -.-> contracts[(data contracts)]\n  clean -.-> audit[(audit log)]\n  link -.-> audit\n  features -.-> audit\n```\n\n## Live dependency graph\n\n`tar_visnetwork()` renders the graph as an interactive `visNetwork` widget:\nnodes carry the target name and runtime, clicking a node shows its output, and\nthe widget renders faster than a large static Mermaid diagram. Only targets are\ndrawn (`targets_only = TRUE`); the functions they call are left out so the data\nflow stays readable.\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\ntar_visnetwork(targets_only = TRUE, allow = NULL, label = \"time\")\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}\n\n```\n+ raw_games_chunk declared [34 branches]\n+ raw_game_player_stats_chunk declared [279 branches]\n+ raw_game_team_stats_chunk declared [279 branches]\n```\n\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"visNetwork html-widget html-fill-item\" id=\"htmlwidget-1f6b1827f19fca001748\" style=\"width:100%;height:464px;\"></div>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-1f6b1827f19fca001748\">{\"x\":{\"nodes\":{\"name\":[\"audit_log\",\"career\",\"coaches\",\"coaches_file\",\"contract_gate\",\"db_audit_log\",\"duckdb_file\",\"exits\",\"game_player_stats\",\"game_player_stats_file\",\"game_team_stats\",\"game_team_stats_file\",\"games\",\"games_file\",\"games_grid\",\"model_fit\",\"model_table\",\"nfl_draft_picks\",\"nfl_draft_picks_file\",\"nfl_player_stats\",\"nfl_player_stats_file\",\"nfl_rosters\",\"nfl_rosters_file\",\"ok_career\",\"ok_change\",\"ok_coach_link\",\"ok_coaches\",\"ok_drafted\",\"ok_game_player_stats\",\"ok_game_team_stats\",\"ok_games\",\"ok_nfl_draft_picks\",\"ok_nfl_link\",\"ok_nfl_player_stats\",\"ok_nfl_rosters\",\"ok_outcomes\",\"ok_picks\",\"ok_player_game\",\"ok_player_season\",\"ok_player_stats\",\"ok_player_usage\",\"ok_position_mapping\",\"ok_position_path\",\"ok_recruit_link\",\"ok_recruiting\",\"ok_reused_filter\",\"ok_roster\",\"ok_season_coverage\",\"ok_stat_taxonomy\",\"ok_team_draft\",\"ok_team_season\",\"ok_teams\",\"ok_tier_link\",\"ok_tiers\",\"ok_weight\",\"outcomes\",\"outcomes_file\",\"picks\",\"picks_file\",\"picks_nfl\",\"player_game\",\"player_season\",\"player_stats\",\"player_stats_file\",\"player_usage\",\"position_counts\",\"position_path\",\"ps_change\",\"ps_coach\",\"ps_draft\",\"ps_pop\",\"ps_recruit\",\"ps_tier\",\"raw_coaches\",\"raw_game_player_stats\",\"raw_game_player_stats_chunk\",\"raw_game_team_stats\",\"raw_game_team_stats_chunk\",\"raw_games\",\"raw_games_chunk\",\"raw_nfl_draft_picks\",\"raw_nfl_player_stats\",\"raw_nfl_rosters\",\"raw_picks\",\"raw_player_stats\",\"raw_recruiting\",\"raw_roster\",\"raw_teams\",\"recruiting\",\"recruiting_file\",\"reused\",\"roster\",\"roster_fi