::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}\n\n```\nAll targets are up to date.\n```\n\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n::: {.callout-important}\n## Known gaps\n`/roster` is now ingested, keyed on an authoritative `season` (stamped from the\nqueried year — the endpoint's own `year` is the eligibility class). But roster\n**weight is static per player**, so the decision-0003 between-season\n`weight_delta` is not derivable and was dropped; we keep the static roster\n`weight`. The `model` and `report` stages are wired placeholders. Post-draft\n**NFL outcomes** (nflverse) are now ingested and bridged to picks by draft slot,\nbut as *labels* — they stay off the model input path to avoid leakage (decision\n0014).\n:::\n",
